 2689.117001593113, "width": 44, "height": 31.855998039245605, "text": {"text": "循环", "font_weight": "regular", "font_size": 22, "horizontal_align": "center", "vertical_align": "top", "line_through": false, "underline": false, "italic": false, "angle": 0, "text_color": "#1b3144", "text_color_type": 1, "text_background_color_type": 0, "theme_text_background_color_code": -1}}, {"id": "a001:45", "type": "text_shape", "x": 70, "y": 2997.9405016303062, "width": 851, "height": 33.30399799346924, "text": {"text": "定时登记与到点事件有依据；本轮去重、结果超时处理及状态回写细节需评审固化。", "font_weight": "regular", "font_size": 23, "horizontal_align": "left", "vertical_align": "top", "line_through": false, "underline": false, "italic": false, "angle": 0, "text_color": "#1b3144", "text_color_type": 1, "text_background_color_type": 0, "theme_text_background_color_code": -1}}, {"id": "a001:46", "type": "text_shape", "x": 70, "y": 3031.290501630306, "width": 851, "height": 33.30399799346924, "text": {"text": "循环错过一轮后如何继续、跨下电和断网处理待确认；箭头不表示已支持离线控车。", "font_weight": "regular", "font_size": 23, "horizontal_align": "left", "vertical_align": "top", "line_through": false, "underline": false, "italic": false, "angle": 0, "text_color": "#1b3144", "text_color_type": 1, "text_background_color_type": 0, "theme_text_background_color_code": -1}}], "idempotent_token": "saic-v02-diagram-03-20261013"}